> - 空间关系类：计数决定偏移(count_determines_offset), 缩放对应(scale_correspondence), 标记相对方位(marker_relative_position), 边邻接计数(edge_adjacency_count), 接触两边缘(touching_two_edges), 对角排布(diag_layout), 同尺寸对齐(same_size_align), 同列传播(same_column_propagation), 掩码匹配(mask_matching), 像素计数编码半径(pixel_count_encodes_radius), 包含(containment), 列遮挡(column_coverage), 孔洞数匹配(hole_count_matching), 同色配对(same_color_pairing), 半区(half_region), 顺序排列(sequential_order), 行列对齐(row_col_align)
> - 条件/判断类：计数器消失(counter_disappears), 色数映射线型(count_maps_line), 八方向匹配(all_orientations_matching), 方位决定象限分配(position_quadrant_assign), 邻接多数决(adjacency_majority_rule), 顺时针到下一角(clockwise_next), 忽略干扰项(ignore_distractors), 空行填分隔色(blank_row_separator), 逐像素替换(pixel_wise_replace), 标记无冲突合并(markers_merge), 沿列填至底(fill_column_to_bottom), 源色覆盖占位副本(source_colors_onto_placeholders), 编码映射(encoding_map), 标记沿短轴展分割(marker_short_axis_div), 遮挡列延伸至边(covered_col_to_edge), 连通孔洞数为键(connected_hole_count_is_key), 两端同色整行填充(full_row_fill_endpoints_match), 障碍触发转向(barrier_triggers_turn), 半区变色(half_recolored), 标记高度决定长度(marker_height_run_len), 同行列端点间填充(fill_between_aligned_endpoints)
