> - 条件/判断类：按形状映射颜色/shape_to_color_mapping, 标记定压缩方向/marker_sets_dir, 相向移动留迹汇合/inward_trails_meet_mark, 访问顺序编码/visitation_order_encoding, 最近优先/nearest_preferred, 标记为对顶点/markers_as_vertices, 内部行段填充/fill_interior_spans, 最高频色覆盖全图/top_freq_fills_grid, 孔洞触发射线/hole_triggers_ray, 碰撞停止/collision_stop, 缺失位补色/fill_missing, 按数量降序/sort_by_count_desc, 靠端对齐/end_aligned_layout, 缺口形状唯一配对/unique_complement, 槽位决定颜色/slot_determines_color, 背景色空洞/background_hole, 标记侧翻转且变色/mirror_toward_marker_recolor, 前景最多者选出/max_foreground_count_selected, 每隔N选取/every_nth_selection, 按位置排序/sort_by_position, 整块移动保持内容/block_move_intact, 顺序反转/order_reversed
>
