# 第 17 轮 · 创新 ARC 题（多逻辑组合）

> 参考题（20 道）：7491f3cf, 782b5218, 22806e14, bf89d739, 5751f35e, a096bf4d, 3194b014, 256b0a75, e26a3af2, f28a3cbb, 08573cc6, 423a55dc, de1cd16c, 9968a131, 55059096, 1a07d186, 69889d6e, f9d67f8b, a57f2f04, a1aa0c1e
>
> 提取的原语（去重）：
>
> - **操作类**：填充/flood_fill, 透明叠加/transparent_overlay, 擦除/erase, 标注中心/mark_center, 连线/draw_line/connect, 补全/complete, 连通检测/connected_component_detection, 筛选/filtering, 纯色填充/solid_color_fill, 对称补全/symmetry_completion/frame_completion, 射线延伸/ray_extension/ray_extend, 去噪/denoise, 重涂色/recolor, 压缩/compress, 滑动/slide/shift/sliding, 螺旋绘制/spiral_drawing, 剪切变换/shear_transform, 计数/counting/count, 投票/vote, 对齐/align, 平铺/tiling, 排序/sort
> - **对象类**：面板/panel, 指示像素/indicator_pixel, 墙壁边界/wall_boundary, 分隔墙/divider_wall, 实心正方形/solid_square, 十字标记/plus_marker, 十字图案/plus_object, 控制像素/control_pixel, 主干线段/spine_segment, 稀疏矩形层/sparse_rect_layer, 嵌套矩形/nested_rectangle, 格子瓦片/lattice_tile, 端点标记/endpoint_marker, 分隔线/separator_line, 单色连通体/monochromatic_connected_object, 矩形框/rectangular_frame, 角落标记/corner_marker, 臂端标记/arm_marker, 条纹行列/stripe_line, 噪声像素/noise_pixel, 锚块/anchor_block, 射线像素/ray_pixel, 中心标记/center_marker, 调色板/palette, 前景对象/foreground_object, 底行锚点/bottom_anchor, 标记像素/marker_pixel, 色块区域/color_region, 双色条/two_color_bar, 参考条/reference_bar, 孤立像素/isolated_pixel, 满行列条/full_span_bar, 源像素/source_pixel, 障碍块/blocker, 遮挡像素/occluding_pixel, 对称图案/symmetric_pattern, 种子图案/seed_pattern, 矩形空腔/rectangular_cavity, 色条/color_bar, 梳状结构/comb_motif, 墙壁/wall
> - **空间关系类**：内外分区/inside_outside_partition, 四连通分区/four_connected_partition, 奇偶性/parity, 连接到主干/connect_to_spine, 由外到内嵌套/outer_to_inner, 同行列对齐/same_row_col_align, 行列对齐/row_col_aligned, 主色占优/dominant_color, 同色射线归属锚块/ray_belongs_anchor, 递增步长/increasing_step_length, 标记归属区域/marker_in_region, 同色对齐/same_color_align, 中心对角对齐/center_diagonal_alignment, 同色配对/same_color_pairing, 碰撞阻挡/collision_blocking, 边缘起始/edge_origin, 对称轨道/symmetry_orbit, 图案填满空腔/pattern_fills_cavity, 高度编码数量/height_encodes_count
> - **条件/判断类**：掩码选择源面板/mask_selects_source_panel, 角落锚定/corner_anchor, 忽略干扰项/ignore_distractors, 奇边长才标注/odd_side_marked, 共行列定义主干/shared_row_col_spine, 大层先画小层覆盖/large_first_small_over, 同色同子格位置/same_color_subcell, 唯一连通分量/unique_component, 最大面积选择/largest_area_selection, 延伸至边或标记/extend_to_edge_or_marker, 主色覆盖全行列/dominant_fills_line, 射线像素紧缩至锚/compact_to_anchor, 边界截断/boundary_truncation, 方向分色/direction_based_color_split, 偏移随行距增/offset_grows_with_distance, 最多标记区胜出/max_marker_wins, 首行为参照/top_row_reference, 无障碍通路/unobstructed_path, 无匹配色则删除/unmatched_deleted, 对角方向/diagonal_direction, 障碍偏转绕行/obstacle_deflection, 反射旋转定颜色/reflect_rotate_color, 保持种子相位/preserve_seed_phase, 奇偶兼容/parity_compatible
>
> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。

