# 第 19 轮 · 创新 ARC 题（多逻辑组合）

> 参考题（20 道）：93b4f4b3, 575b1a71, e9ac8c9e, 4acc7107, 40853293, ce9e57f2, bda2d7a6, ecdecbb3, 7c66cb00, 1d398264, 2013d3e2, 239be575, e8593010, 0dfd9992, 3f7978a0, 15663ba9, 7b5033c1, fcc82909, 1b60fb0c, c8cbb738
>
> 提取的原语（去重）：
>
> - **操作类**：填充/fill, 形状匹配/shape_matching, 重涂色/recolor, 分割/split, 堆叠/stacking, 排序/sorting, 连线/draw_line, 射线延伸/ray_extend, 印章覆盖/stamp_overlay, 对接/dock, 色彩互换/color_swap, 擦除/erase, 裁剪/crop, 旋转/rotate, 连通判定/connectivity_test, 计数/counting, 补全/inpaint, 环路追踪/trace_cycle, 分类涂色/classify_and_color, 展直/straighten, 绘制/drawing, 对称补全/symmetry_completion, 透明叠加/transparent_overlay
> - **对象类**：模板/template, 封闭孔洞/enclosed_hole, 单色对象/monochrome_object, 前景像素/foreground_pixel, 实心矩形/solid_rect, 对角标记像素/diag_marker, 象限/quadrant, 单色前景对象/monochrome_foreground_object, 标记像素/marker_pixel, 线段/line_segment, 竖直条/vertical_bar, 同心正方形层/concentric_ring, 贯穿条/full_span_bar, 控制像素/control_pixel, 接触标记/contact_marker, 双色精灵体/two_tone_sprite, 色条/color_bar, 实心方块/filled_square, 射线/ray, 精灵体/sprite, 前景对象/foreground_object, 桥接路径/bridge_path, 连通分量/connected_component, 周期瓦片/periodic_tile, 竖直线段/vertical_segment, 角标记像素/corner_marker, 闭合正交环路/closed_orthogonal_loop, 弯折像素/bend_pixel, 直行像素/straight_pixel, 蛇形路径/snake_path, 端点/endpoint, 多色方块/multicolor_square, 标记矩形/marker_rect, 边界框/bounding_box, 前景掩码/foreground_mask
> - **空间关系类**：形状对应/shape_correspondence, 列归属/column_membership, 角落对应/corner_correspond, 位置排序/positional_ordering, 同色配对/same_color_pairing, 行列对齐/row_col_align, 等分/equal_split, 嵌套层序/nesting_order, 投射/perpendicular_cast, 同色匹配/same_color_matching, 中心向外辐射/radiate_from_center, 罗盘方向/compass_direction, 旋转对称/rotational_symmetry, 连通性/connectivity, 面积分级/area_ranking, 平移对称/translational_symmetry, 边界/boundary, 邻接放置/adjacent_placement, 中心对齐/center_alignment, 遍历顺序/traversal_order
> - **条件/判断类**：匹配形状决定填色/shape_determines_fill, 列序映射颜色/column_rank_to_color, 标记色映射象限/marker_color_to_quad, 对齐紧凑排布/aligned_compact_layout, 按颜色分组/group_by_color, 竖线交叉优先/vertical_priority_at_cross, 下半变色/lower_half_recolored, 色沿层序循环移/colors_cycle_by_nesting, 命中处印标记/stamp_at_hit, 颜色反转映射/inverted_color_mapping, 排除中心像素/exclude_center_pixel, 提取原始瓦片/extract_source_tile, 连通输出色否则黑/connected_color_else_black, 面积决定颜色/area_determines_color, 轨道可见色填缺失/orbit_color_restores_missing, 线段定裁剪列范围/lines_set_crop_columns, 扩展含角标行/row_includes_corner_markers, 多数转向为凸/majority_turn_is_convex, 少数转向为凹/minority_turn_is_concave, 保留像素序/preserve_pixel_order, 颜色数决定高度/color_count_height, 缺失部分标记新色/missing_marked_new_color, 多色掩码合并/multi_mask_merge
>
> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。

