> - 空间关系类：栅格偏移(lattice_offset), 接缝对齐(seam_alignment), 内部面积(interior_area), 循环对称(cyclic_symmetry), 颜色多重集相同(same_color_multiset), 重复(repetition), 距离映射(distance_mapping), 交替翻转(alternating_flip), 行列唯一约束(row_column_uniqueness_constraint), 邻接接触(adjacency_contact), 对角邻接拼合(diagonal_adj_join), 有序槽位(ordered_slots), 包围框对齐(bounding_box_alignment), 中心对齐(center_alignment), 颜色配对映射(color_pair_mapping), 角落对应(corner_correspond), 面积比较(area_comparison), 锚定定位(anchor_positioning), 标记对齐(marker_alignment)
> - 条件/判断类：重叠区域重涂(overlap_recolor), 控制像素对齐拼接(control_pixel_concat), 面积阈值决定颜色(area_threshold_determines_color), 已有推断缺失像素(existing_infer_missing), 标记所在象限保留(marker_quadrant_retained), 各区域缺像素(region_miss_pixel), 宽度加倍拼接(width_doubling_concatenation), 切比雪夫距离(chebyshev_distance), 中心对齐(center_aligned), 单行重叠拼接(one_row_overlap), 拉丁方约束(latin_square_constraint), 标记选中邻接体(marker_selects_neighbor), 颜色互换且偏移(color_swap_offset), 色与高反向轮转(color_height_rotate), 对象移入标记矩形(object_moved_into_marker_rectangle), 画布全长十字线(canvas_spanning_cross), 原对象遮挡叠加(object_occludes_overlay), 标记色定窗口填充(marker_sets_window_fill), 标记定旋转源目(marker_rot_src_tgt), 仅保留最大矩形(only_largest_rectangle_retained), 标记定输出朝向(marker_fixes_orientation), 面积排序叠加(area_sorted_overlay)
